WEBVTT

00:10.890 --> 00:13.520
<b>Class is in session.</b>

00:13.520 --> 00:16.860
<b>Last time, we learned the basics of magic.</b>

00:16.860 --> 00:21.950
<b>Were you able to feel
the magic power inside your body?</b>

00:21.950 --> 00:24.780
<b>For those of you who haven't yet,
you'll be doing the same training today.</b>

00:24.780 --> 00:29.700
<b>If you've already finished that part,
we'll move on to the next step,</b>

00:29.700 --> 00:33.250
<b>which is to control the magic power
in your body to expel it outwards.</b>

00:36.540 --> 00:40.590
<b>It's only been one month
since I arrived at the academy,</b>

00:40.590 --> 00:43.550
<b>and the boredom is already insufferable.</b>

00:43.550 --> 00:48.140
<b>All of the lessons are basic things
that I've learned before coming here.</b>

00:48.140 --> 00:50.270
<b>Also...</b>

00:50.270 --> 00:56.860
<b>The title of "Duke's daughter"
seems to push people away.</b>

01:04.910 --> 01:06.870
<b>Is something wrong, young lady?</b>

01:06.870 --> 01:08.030
<b>Huh?</b>

02:42.000 --> 02:47.010
<b>"Episode 9"
"Eliaria and the New Friends"</b>

02:47.970 --> 02:51.470
<b>You are... Count Wildan's...</b>

02:51.470 --> 02:53.010
<b>Pardon me.</b>

02:53.010 --> 02:56.930
<b>I am Michelle, eldest daughter
of Count Wildan.</b>

02:56.930 --> 03:02.770
<b>I didn't realize I was addressing
Lady Jamil from behind.</b>

03:02.770 --> 03:04.610
<b>Please pardon my terrible manners.</b>

03:04.610 --> 03:09.700
<b>There's nothing to pardon.
Our status doesn't matter here.</b>

03:09.700 --> 03:12.780
<b>May I call you Miss Michelle?</b>

03:12.780 --> 03:15.240
<b>Of course, my lady.</b>

03:15.240 --> 03:20.920
<b>Please call me Elia, not "my lady."</b>

03:20.920 --> 03:23.380
<b>Good, then I'll just call you Elia.</b>

03:23.380 --> 03:27.710
<b>You don't mind if I relax my tone, too,
do you? It's really tiring.</b>

03:27.710 --> 03:31.220
<b>Of course. I'm more comfortable
that way, too.</b>

03:31.220 --> 03:36.970
<b>Right. So anyway, what are you
doing out here, all alone?</b>

03:36.970 --> 03:40.940
<b>Oh, it's not that I'm facing
an actual problem.</b>

03:40.940 --> 03:44.060
<b>Just that, the lessons here
are a little, well...</b>

03:44.060 --> 03:47.480
<b>Ah, yes. I actually feel the same way.</b>

03:47.480 --> 03:51.450
<b>I'm mostly just pretending
to take lessons now.</b>

03:51.450 --> 03:54.410
<b>Also, because I'm trying to avoid
getting involved in weird factions,</b>

03:54.410 --> 03:57.910
<b>I end up not having anyone
to talk to during breaks.</b>

03:57.910 --> 04:04.040
<b>Oh, really? I thought you were popular.</b>

04:04.880 --> 04:07.380
<b>Yeah, when I first arrived...</b>

04:07.380 --> 04:11.840
<b>Several female students had the wrong idea
and I got their attention for a while.</b>

04:11.840 --> 04:15.600
<b>Besides, I'm not very social at all.</b>

04:15.600 --> 04:18.350
<b>I see. Is that why you're here?</b>

04:18.350 --> 04:20.310
<b>Not today.</b>

04:20.310 --> 04:22.810
<b>Today, I'm here to do an experiment.</b>

04:22.810 --> 04:26.860
<b>Are you an alchemist?</b>

04:26.860 --> 04:30.240
<b>Unfortunately, I'm not an alchemist.</b>

04:30.240 --> 04:33.070
<b>I'm studying a form of magic
called "magic circle science."</b>

04:33.070 --> 04:35.950
<b>Magic circle science?</b>

04:35.950 --> 04:42.000
<b>Yeah. It's a very minor field of study
that branched off from alchemy.</b>

04:42.000 --> 04:46.670
<b>The only teacher who
taught it here quit last year.</b>

04:46.670 --> 04:49.250
<b>So I have no choice but to
study it on my own.</b>

04:49.250 --> 04:50.670
<b>I see.</b>

04:50.670 --> 04:56.680
<b>Yes. By the way, Elia, I'm impressed that
you knew about alchemy and magic circles.</b>

04:56.680 --> 04:57.550
<b>Huh?</b>

04:57.550 --> 05:02.850
<b>The general public seem to have
misconceptions about alchemy,</b>

05:02.850 --> 05:05.600
<b>but you don't seem to have the negative
impression that others do.</b>

05:07.310 --> 05:09.150
<b>That's because...</b>

05:09.150 --> 05:13.360
<b>If possible, I'd like to learn
more about alchemy from you.</b>

05:13.360 --> 05:18.700
<b>Unfortunately, I don't know
anything about alchemy, either.</b>

05:18.700 --> 05:21.870
<b>I've met an alchemist before,
and that's the extent of my knowledge.</b>

05:21.870 --> 05:27.460
<b>I see. Well, I'll begin my experiment now.</b>

05:27.460 --> 05:29.380
<b>May I watch?</b>

05:29.380 --> 05:30.960
<b>Of course.</b>

05:30.960 --> 05:32.670
<b>What's that?</b>

05:32.670 --> 05:37.300
<b>This is ink mixed with crushed fire-
and neutral-elemental magic crystals.</b>

05:37.300 --> 05:38.970
<b>I use it to draw magic circles.</b>

05:38.970 --> 05:41.350
<b>What does that change?</b>

05:41.350 --> 05:45.690
<b>If I send magic energy through here,
I can start a fire from the magic circle.</b>

05:45.690 --> 05:50.980
<b>I don't know what pattern to draw
to get the most efficiency.</b>

05:50.980 --> 05:53.780
<b>That's why I have to keep experimenting.</b>

05:53.780 --> 05:58.160
<b>I see. Why are you doing this research?</b>

05:58.160 --> 06:00.240
<b>Because it seems interesting.</b>

06:00.240 --> 06:06.330
<b>If a field lacks research,
that means there's more to discover, right?</b>

06:06.330 --> 06:11.290
<b>Miss Michelle reminds me
of Mr. Ryoma, in a way.</b>

06:12.420 --> 06:16.220
<b>I don't know for sure what kind of reaction
this will generate, so stand back.</b>

06:16.220 --> 06:18.090
<b>Oh, right.</b>

06:25.430 --> 06:28.140
<b>One, two, three.</b>

06:32.650 --> 06:36.740
<b>I'm sorry to startle you. My apologies.</b>

06:36.740 --> 06:41.780
<b>Oh, I apologize as well for interfering.</b>

06:41.780 --> 06:46.620
<b>You didn't interfere at all.
You're Miss Miyabi, are you not?</b>

06:46.620 --> 06:48.620
<b>From the same class, right?</b>

06:48.620 --> 06:53.840
<b>Yes... I actually have a message
from an acquaintance. So...</b>

06:53.840 --> 06:57.300
<b>A message for me? Who is it from?</b>

06:57.300 --> 07:00.550
<b>Well, it's from a boy.</b>

07:00.550 --> 07:03.720
<b>So I didn't want to start a weird rumor
about the duke's daughter...</b>

07:03.720 --> 07:07.560
<b>Don't worry, please speak freely.</b>

07:07.560 --> 07:11.860
<b>Do you recognize the name "Ryoma"?</b>

07:11.860 --> 07:15.980
<b>From Mr. Ryoma?! How do you know
about him, Miss Miyabi?</b>

07:15.980 --> 07:20.780
<b>I met him through my father. When I told him
I'd be attending the academy,</b>

07:20.780 --> 07:24.740
<b>he asked me to "send a message
to a girl named Elia there."</b>

07:24.740 --> 07:29.290
<b>I see. So what did he say?</b>

07:29.290 --> 07:30.830
<b>"Good luck."</b>

07:30.830 --> 07:35.840
<b>That's it. He seemed to be
worried about you.</b>

07:38.880 --> 07:43.050
<b>I don't have anyone
close enough to call a friend.</b>

07:43.050 --> 07:49.390
<b>Most people are afraid of either
my status or my magical power.</b>

07:49.390 --> 07:55.400
<b>Mr. Ryoma must have set up an opportunity
for me to meet Miss Miyabi.</b>

07:55.400 --> 08:00.400
<b>Thank you very much. Message received.</b>

08:00.400 --> 08:06.990
<b>Miss Miyabi, can we make the best of
this opportunity and become friends?</b>

08:06.990 --> 08:10.830
<b>Are you sure? I'm not someone special enough
to be friends with the duke's daughter.</b>

08:10.830 --> 08:14.710
<b>Status doesn't matter here.</b>

08:14.710 --> 08:19.960
<b>Besides, it would be sad to spend my days
here at the academy without friends.</b>

08:22.090 --> 08:24.840
<b>In that case, nice to meet you.</b>

08:24.840 --> 08:28.260
<b>I'd like to join you, if that's all right.</b>

08:28.260 --> 08:30.560
<b>Of course!</b>

08:30.560 --> 08:36.310
<b>Hey, what do you think about the three of us
forming a team for practical training?</b>

08:37.570 --> 08:41.030
<b>Yes, I had worries about forming
a team for a while now.</b>

08:41.030 --> 08:44.530
<b>Me, too. I kind of ended up
not joining any.</b>

08:44.530 --> 08:50.330
<b>The existing teams are mostly based
on status--all nobles or all commoners.</b>

08:50.330 --> 08:53.420
<b>They didn't seem
very comfortable to be in.</b>

08:53.420 --> 08:58.340
<b>We would have been forced
to enter a random team.</b>

08:58.340 --> 09:00.340
<b>That would've been rough.</b>

09:00.340 --> 09:06.340
<b>Yeah, I wanted to be in a team
with people I got along with.</b>

09:06.340 --> 09:12.100
<b>The three of us should have
a very fun time. Thank you!</b>

09:12.100 --> 09:13.230
<b>Same here!</b>

09:13.230 --> 09:14.770
<b>It's settled, then.</b>

09:14.770 --> 09:15.600
<b>Yes.</b>

09:15.600 --> 09:18.730
<b>But teams are supposed to have
five or six people, right?</b>

09:18.730 --> 09:22.990
<b>We'll have to find
two or three more people.</b>

09:22.990 --> 09:28.830
<b>I wonder if we can find someone who
doesn't care about status, like you two.</b>

09:28.830 --> 09:31.830
<b>I can think of one person.</b>

09:33.620 --> 09:37.790
<b>Riela Clifford. She's the eldest
daughter of Baron Clifford.</b>

09:37.790 --> 09:41.670
<b>If I remember correctly, her family
used to be a family of knights,</b>

09:41.670 --> 09:45.470
<b>and was granted the status of baron
through their successes, right?</b>

09:45.470 --> 09:50.220
<b>Yes. She's very proud of herself
and can be a bit fussy about rules,</b>

09:50.220 --> 09:53.220
<b>but she never looks down
on others based on status,</b>

09:53.220 --> 09:55.640
<b>and is happy to acknowledge
the talents that other people show.</b>

09:55.640 --> 09:58.100
<b>She sounds great.</b>

09:58.100 --> 10:00.570
<b>I-I yield.</b>

10:05.450 --> 10:07.280
<b>Riela.</b>

10:07.280 --> 10:11.530
<b>Oh, Michelle. And...?</b>

10:11.530 --> 10:14.200
<b>Can we talk?</b>

10:15.960 --> 10:21.670
<b>Yes. It would be an honor
to join your team.</b>

10:22.670 --> 10:24.210
<b>Really?!</b>

10:24.210 --> 10:25.340
<b>Great!</b>

10:25.340 --> 10:31.600
<b>Are you sure? I heard you're top of
the class in swordsmanship,</b>

10:31.600 --> 10:35.520
<b>and are being sought after
from many teams.</b>

10:35.520 --> 10:37.890
<b>I did receive a few invitations,</b>

10:37.890 --> 10:43.110
<b>but I don't want to join anyone who mistakes
the honor of nobility with boastful pride.</b>

10:43.110 --> 10:45.780
<b>Nice to meet you, Miss Riela.</b>

10:45.780 --> 10:47.570
<b>Nice to meet you!</b>

10:47.570 --> 10:48.910
<b>Likewise.</b>

10:48.910 --> 10:52.580
<b>We'd like to have one more person join us.</b>

10:52.580 --> 10:56.330
<b>Can you think of anyone?</b>

10:56.330 --> 10:59.710
<b>Well, I can think of one person, but...</b>

10:59.710 --> 11:05.880
<b>In combat training, out of the four of us,
only Riela can fight in close range.</b>

11:05.880 --> 11:10.970
<b>Yes. It'd be ideal to have
one more close-ranged ally.</b>

11:10.970 --> 11:14.390
<b>Unfortunately, the girl
I thought of is a scout type</b>

11:14.390 --> 11:19.890
<b>who's good at traps and covert actions
and those types of things.</b>

11:19.890 --> 11:24.150
<b>Speaking of which, there she is.</b>

11:24.150 --> 11:25.400
<b>That's her?</b>

11:25.400 --> 11:27.360
<b>Her name is Kanan.</b>

11:27.360 --> 11:32.120
<b>She's a commoner. She's skilled
with her fingers and good with crafts.</b>

11:32.120 --> 11:35.290
<b>She wants to become a craftsman.</b>

11:35.290 --> 11:37.660
<b>I see. What do you think?</b>

11:37.660 --> 11:40.830
<b>If her personality is good,
I have no issues.</b>

11:40.830 --> 11:42.960
<b>I'm fine, as well.</b>

11:42.960 --> 11:45.840
<b>I'll go talk to her, then!</b>

11:45.840 --> 11:48.050
<b>I got rejected again...</b>

11:48.050 --> 11:51.220
<b>Hey, Kanan, may I
talk to you for a moment?</b>

11:52.220 --> 11:58.020
<b>Um, Miss Miyabi, right?
What do you want from me?</b>

11:58.020 --> 12:01.600
<b>I'm looking for a member to join my team.</b>

12:01.600 --> 12:04.730
<b>I was wondering if you could--</b>

12:04.730 --> 12:06.110
<b>Seriously?!</b>

12:06.110 --> 12:11.110
<b>Y-Yeah. Come speak with
the rest of my team.</b>

12:11.110 --> 12:13.820
<b>I-I'd be happy to!</b>

12:13.820 --> 12:17.040
<b>I'm Kanan Schuzer! Nice to meet you!</b>

12:17.040 --> 12:19.660
<b>Nice to meet you, too.</b>

12:19.660 --> 12:22.830
<b>Schuzer? Is that...</b>

12:22.830 --> 12:28.590
<b>Yes. I don't want to sound like I'm boasting,
but I'm from the Schuzer family.</b>

12:28.590 --> 12:31.170
<b>We're quite famous
for our magic item crafts.</b>

12:31.170 --> 12:35.300
<b>Although, where magic item crafting
is concerned, I'm a failure.</b>

12:35.300 --> 12:37.970
<b>Please don't expect anything
from me on that front.</b>

12:37.970 --> 12:39.640
<b>A failure?</b>

12:39.640 --> 12:45.190
<b>I'm an enchanter magician that
specializes in enchanting magic.</b>

12:45.190 --> 12:46.900
<b>I see. That explains it.</b>

12:46.900 --> 12:47.650
<b>Huh?</b>

12:47.650 --> 12:50.400
<b>I'm sorry, but can you
put that into simpler terms?</b>

12:50.400 --> 12:51.780
<b>Oh, yes.</b>

12:51.780 --> 12:56.910
<b>It's said that enchantment magic was developed
by a person with a unique idiosyncrasy,</b>

12:56.910 --> 13:02.120
<b>and can only be used by those
who are born in that bloodline.</b>

13:02.120 --> 13:04.500
<b>The bloodline has grown
and spread over the years,</b>

13:04.500 --> 13:09.960
<b>but on rare occasions, a person is born with
the exact same idiosyncrasy as the progenitor.</b>

13:09.960 --> 13:11.510
<b>And that's you?</b>

13:11.510 --> 13:15.300
<b>Yes. To be specific,</b>

13:15.300 --> 13:20.890
<b>I can't use any magic
other than enchanting magic.</b>

13:20.890 --> 13:24.640
<b>I can't make magic items on my own.</b>

13:24.640 --> 13:27.900
<b>If I remember correctly,
to make a magic item,</b>

13:27.900 --> 13:31.650
<b>you need both the enchanting magic
and the actual magic you want to enchant.</b>

13:31.650 --> 13:35.200
<b>So you need the help of others.</b>

13:35.200 --> 13:36.240
<b>Yes...</b>

13:36.240 --> 13:40.280
<b>But to work with others,
you need to be compatible with them.</b>

13:40.280 --> 13:46.750
<b>Exactly. I thought, perhaps here at
the academy, I'd meet many people,</b>

13:46.750 --> 13:50.250
<b>so I might be able to run into someone
who is compatible with me, but...</b>

13:50.250 --> 13:54.300
<b>Other students, especially the nobles,
wouldn't even listen to me.</b>

13:54.300 --> 13:57.010
<b>I couldn't find anyone to work with me.</b>

13:57.010 --> 14:01.560
<b>I see. I'm sorry to pry into
your private life like this.</b>

14:01.560 --> 14:05.100
<b>Thank you for telling us your secret.</b>

14:05.100 --> 14:06.020
<b>It's fine!</b>

14:06.020 --> 14:12.360
<b>I can't escape discussing it
if I'm going to join a team.</b>

14:12.360 --> 14:16.150
<b>I don't have a problem with having
her join us. What do you think?</b>

14:16.150 --> 14:17.820
<b>I agree.</b>

14:17.820 --> 14:21.080
<b>I would love to have her on our team.</b>

14:21.080 --> 14:23.040
<b>Then, it's settled!</b>

14:23.040 --> 14:26.660
<b>Really? You'll let me join?</b>

14:26.660 --> 14:30.750
<b>I can't use any magic and I'm
a complete novice with swords, too.</b>

14:30.750 --> 14:32.800
<b>Every person has their own specialties.</b>

14:32.800 --> 14:35.170
<b>I'll protect you in a fight.</b>

14:35.170 --> 14:39.590
<b>Well then, Kanan will join our team.</b>

14:39.590 --> 14:43.510
<b>Unless, of course, you don't want to...</b>

14:43.510 --> 14:46.890
<b>Of course I want to! Thank you!</b>

14:46.890 --> 14:52.190
<b>I was rejected by so many teams so far,
I was at a total loss!</b>

14:52.190 --> 14:54.690
<b>Nice to meet you all!</b>

14:54.690 --> 14:56.110
<b>Likewise.</b>

14:56.110 --> 14:57.490
<b>Nice to meet you.</b>

14:57.490 --> 14:59.410
<b>Very nice to meet you.</b>

14:59.410 --> 15:02.240
<b>This is going to be fun.</b>

15:02.240 --> 15:04.700
<b>They teamed up with nobles?</b>

15:04.700 --> 15:07.160
<b>It's bound to fail.</b>

15:07.160 --> 15:09.040
<b>I can hear the rumors.</b>

15:09.040 --> 15:11.540
<b>It's what we expected.</b>

15:11.540 --> 15:12.380
<b>Nonsense.</b>

15:12.380 --> 15:15.340
<b>To be honest, I didn't expect
three of you to be nobles,</b>

15:15.340 --> 15:21.010
<b>including the daughter of the duke.
I was so shocked, I thought I'd die.</b>

15:22.850 --> 15:26.720
<b>Hey, do any of you know
how to set up a camp?</b>

15:26.720 --> 15:28.390
<b>Not me.</b>

15:28.390 --> 15:29.940
<b>Me, neither.</b>

15:29.940 --> 15:32.230
<b>I've done it a few times.</b>

15:32.230 --> 15:35.270
<b>I've also received training
from my family.</b>

15:35.270 --> 15:37.190
<b>So we have two people with experience.</b>

15:37.190 --> 15:39.030
<b>That's reassuring.</b>

15:39.030 --> 15:41.280
<b>Let's stay sharp.</b>

15:41.280 --> 15:44.330
<b>Yes. Oh, here comes the teacher.</b>

15:44.330 --> 15:46.990
<b>Good, you're all here.</b>

15:46.990 --> 15:49.870
<b>--We will now begin the two-night
outdoor camping training.</b>

15:49.870 --> 15:51.960
<b>--This is our first
practical training session.
--We will now begin the two-night
outdoor camping training.</b>

15:51.960 --> 15:54.840
<b>We'll get it done together.</b>

15:54.840 --> 15:57.920
<b>Please say "enchanter magician that specializes
in enchanting magic" three times quickly.</b>

15:57.920 --> 16:00.380
<b>--One, two!
--Our attempt, right after this!</b>

16:00.380 --> 16:02.090
<b>"Enchanter magician that
specializes in enchanting magic,</b>

16:02.090 --> 16:03.390
<b>enchanter magician that
specializes in enchanting magic,</b>

16:03.390 --> 16:05.470
<b>enchanter magician that
specializes in enchanting magic."</b>

16:05.470 --> 16:08.220
<b>We won't forbid you from
interacting with other teams,</b>

16:08.220 --> 16:12.900
<b>but please do the work for your team
by yourselves. Understood?</b>

16:12.900 --> 16:14.520
<b>Yes!</b>

16:14.520 --> 16:17.690
<b>These students are just
12-year-old children.</b>

16:17.690 --> 16:19.440
<b>They've been raised in well-to-do families</b>

16:19.440 --> 16:23.450
<b>and must have had servants
take care of their everyday needs.</b>

16:23.450 --> 16:27.660
<b>Please watch over them as they
take on this new challenge.</b>

16:27.660 --> 16:28.830
<b>Yes.</b>

16:28.830 --> 16:31.120
<b>Oh, what are you doing?!</b>

16:31.120 --> 16:33.420
<b>I've never done this before.</b>

16:33.420 --> 16:35.710
<b>Neither have I.</b>

16:37.420 --> 16:39.380
<b>Ugh, it's not working!</b>

16:39.380 --> 16:41.220
<b>What?! There's no toilet?!</b>

16:41.220 --> 16:43.050
<b>No bath, either.</b>

16:43.050 --> 16:44.550
<b>What?!</b>

16:44.550 --> 16:46.100
<b>Good, now pull!</b>

16:46.100 --> 16:47.600
<b>Right!</b>

16:50.140 --> 16:51.560
<b>Does this work?</b>

16:51.560 --> 16:54.020
<b>Yes, that's fine.</b>

16:54.020 --> 16:56.270
<b>Here we go!</b>

16:57.400 --> 16:58.820
<b>Wow.</b>

16:58.820 --> 17:00.860
<b>I'm glad we practiced beforehand.</b>

17:00.860 --> 17:03.610
<b>I remember back when
we couldn't do it at all.</b>

17:03.610 --> 17:07.530
<b>Hey, build our tent for us.</b>

17:07.530 --> 17:13.870
<b>Huh? But the teacher said you have to
take care of your own team's needs.</b>

17:13.870 --> 17:16.000
<b>But we can't do it.</b>

17:16.000 --> 17:18.920
<b>That's your fault for not coming prepared!</b>

17:18.920 --> 17:20.210
<b>What did you say?!</b>

17:20.210 --> 17:21.920
<b>What?!</b>

17:27.300 --> 17:31.560
<b>Well, I knew this wouldn't
all go smoothly, but...</b>

17:31.560 --> 17:34.270
<b>Some scuffles occurring
here and there, it seems.</b>

17:34.270 --> 17:36.520
<b>I'm worried about tomorrow.</b>

17:36.520 --> 17:38.310
<b>Just leave them.</b>

17:38.310 --> 17:40.480
<b>We should rest for now.</b>

17:40.480 --> 17:42.440
<b>We have to wake up early tomorrow.</b>

17:42.440 --> 17:44.780
<b>You're right. Good night.</b>

17:44.780 --> 17:46.450
<b>Good night.</b>

17:46.450 --> 17:48.200
<b>Good night.</b>

17:51.370 --> 17:53.620
<b>It hurts!</b>

17:55.120 --> 17:56.540
<b>What's wrong?</b>

17:56.540 --> 17:59.340
<b>The tent suddenly fell, and she got hurt.</b>

17:59.340 --> 18:00.210
<b>Hurt?</b>

18:00.210 --> 18:04.300
<b>Just a scratch,
nothing serious... I think.</b>

18:04.300 --> 18:06.220
<b>I see.</b>

18:08.510 --> 18:10.550
<b>It hurts!</b>

18:10.550 --> 18:15.310
<b>This wouldn't have happened
if you all built the tent!</b>

18:15.310 --> 18:18.980
<b>It's your fault for being
bad at building tents.</b>

18:18.980 --> 18:20.770
<b>Stop blaming others!</b>

18:20.770 --> 18:23.030
<b>S-Silence!</b>

18:24.320 --> 18:25.990
<b>Whoa, hold up!</b>

18:25.990 --> 18:28.910
<b>That's not a good use of magic!</b>

18:28.910 --> 18:29.950
<b>But...</b>

18:29.950 --> 18:33.450
<b>Let's get that tent fixed up.
Riela, take command.</b>

18:33.450 --> 18:34.450
<b>Understood.</b>

18:34.450 --> 18:36.540
<b>I'll tend to the injury.</b>

18:37.830 --> 18:39.420
<b>A slime...</b>

18:39.420 --> 18:42.500
<b>It's a healing slime
that can heal injuries.</b>

18:42.500 --> 18:46.630
<b>It's a precious treasure
I've borrowed from a friend.</b>

18:46.630 --> 18:48.050
<b>Huh...</b>

18:49.050 --> 18:50.850
<b>Thank you very much.</b>

18:50.850 --> 18:53.010
<b>Um, I'm sorry.</b>

18:53.010 --> 18:56.640
<b>We're not the ones
you should be apologizing to.</b>

18:56.640 --> 18:57.850
<b>Huh?</b>

19:01.810 --> 19:03.020
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

19:03.020 --> 19:04.820
<b>We said too much.</b>

19:06.780 --> 19:08.900
<b>--Yeah.
--It's all right.</b>

19:08.900 --> 19:10.530
<b>Thank you.</b>

19:12.160 --> 19:15.290
<b>The day has just begun.</b>

19:15.290 --> 19:18.370
<b>In order to succeed in this training
exercise today and tomorrow,</b>

19:18.370 --> 19:22.670
<b>we all have to work together
as one, I think.</b>

19:22.670 --> 19:26.340
<b>Can we cooperate?</b>

19:26.340 --> 19:27.510
<b>Yeah.</b>

19:27.510 --> 19:29.930
<b>Yeah, Elia is right.</b>

19:29.930 --> 19:31.140
<b>Yes.</b>

19:34.140 --> 19:36.810
<b>Now, let's get to it!</b>

19:41.230 --> 19:43.310
<b>That solves the toilet issue.</b>

19:43.310 --> 19:45.400
<b>Wow!</b>

19:45.400 --> 19:47.650
<b>Yes, that's right.</b>

19:47.650 --> 19:51.360
<b>Wow, Miss Kanan,
you really do have nimble fingers.</b>

19:51.360 --> 19:56.080
<b>I've never built a trap like this before.
Where did you learn this?</b>

19:56.080 --> 20:00.870
<b>I saw a friend build this a while ago.</b>

20:02.920 --> 20:04.880
<b>Those are edible.</b>

20:04.880 --> 20:06.460
<b>Wow!</b>

20:09.630 --> 20:11.550
<b>So delicious!</b>

20:18.640 --> 20:19.890
<b>Whoa!</b>

20:20.770 --> 20:22.600
<b>It's too heavy to carry alone.</b>

20:22.600 --> 20:25.480
<b>Oh... Thank you.</b>

20:33.570 --> 20:37.330
<b>They've grown up quite a bit
in such a short time.</b>

20:37.330 --> 20:42.370
<b>Children grow so quickly,
if given the opportunity to do so.</b>

20:42.370 --> 20:47.960
<b>Eliaria Jamil's team did a good job
providing that opportunity this time.</b>

20:50.260 --> 20:53.970
<b>We're already going back tomorrow?
That's too soon.</b>

20:53.970 --> 20:59.640
<b>I was worried at first, but I'm glad
I got to talk to the rest of the class.</b>

20:59.640 --> 21:01.350
<b>Indeed.</b>

21:01.350 --> 21:07.190
<b>I used to avoid interacting with people,
but I'll try to be more social from now on.</b>

21:07.190 --> 21:12.700
<b>Yes. We're all friends sharing
our time together in the academy.</b>

21:12.700 --> 21:14.200
<b>Friends...</b>

21:14.200 --> 21:18.330
<b>I'm sure you have worries about
going to the academy in the capital,</b>

21:18.330 --> 21:24.460
<b>but I'm sure you'll be able to
make friends there quickly.</b>

21:24.460 --> 21:27.290
<b>Um, Miss Eliaria.</b>

21:28.290 --> 21:29.840
<b>This...</b>

21:29.840 --> 21:32.920
<b>What a pretty flower! Is this for me?</b>

21:32.920 --> 21:37.390
<b>Y-Yes. It's for helping me out earlier.</b>

21:37.390 --> 21:39.310
<b>Thank you.</b>

21:47.060 --> 21:48.610
<b>Mr. Ryoma.</b>

21:49.650 --> 21:53.320
<b>I think I now have people
I can call friends!</b>

21:53.320 --> 21:55.990
<b>That's great, Elia.</b>

21:55.990 --> 21:58.990
<b>The flowers I got from my friend
had berries growing alongside them.</b>

21:58.990 --> 22:04.000
<b>The healing and scavenger slimes
seemed to think they were delicious.</b>

22:04.000 --> 22:05.080
<b>--Please see if your slimes enjoy them, too!</b>

22:05.080 --> 22:06.710
<b>--Do you all like it?
--Please see if your slimes enjoy them, too!</b>
